      "message": "`Environment.isExternalStorageManager()` is `true`, so I couldn\u0027t find a reason to show an UI to toggle it. Do we need need logic for it?\n\nDear Akilesh, could you check whether the permission is granted for bundled apps? I think that VmTerminalApp is the same case with the files apps which doesn\u0027t ask for permission.",
