      "writtenOn": "2024-11-11T13:40:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because it\u0027s app-ops permission as well(OP_MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE), a user can revoke the permission via Settings \u003e Apps\u003e Special app access \u003e All files access. It\u0027s basically turned on, but a user can turn off app-ops permission.\n\nBTW, the string should be defined in strings.xml instead of hardcoded value or we can just remove Toast for this.",
      "parentUuid": "ded362b5_44e2ea01",
      "revId": "1069dfdddf3dd644e8e364e3c844a19debbe79ea",
